# Shift+Alt+A wraps a selection in `/* ` and ` */` with the inner text still selected, a second press unwraps it, and at a caret it puts the caret inside `/*  */`.
select 17:20 17:27
key block-comment
expect line 17     Color::srgb_u8(/* r, g, b */)
expect carets 1 primary 1 17:23..17:30
key block-comment
expect line 17     Color::srgb_u8(r, g, b)
expect carets 1 primary 1 17:20..17:27
expect undo-depth 2
caret 13:4
key block-comment
expect line 13 pub/*  */ struct Monokai;
expect carets 1 primary 1 13:7
key undo
expect line 13 pub struct Monokai;
expect carets 1 primary 1 13:4
